---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 mb-8 block">← Back to home</a>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-10">Last updated: March 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-gray-600">
      <p>By using Career Watch ("Service") you agree to these terms. Please read them carefully.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">1. Use of the Service</h2>
      <p>Career Watch is a web monitoring service. You may use it to track publicly accessible career pages. You must not use the Service to monitor pages you are not authorised to access, or in any way that violates applicable law.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">2. Accounts</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure. You must be 18 or older to use the Service. One person or legal entity may not maintain more than one free account.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">3. Payments</h2>
      <p>Paid plans are billed monthly in advance. All payments are processed by Stripe. You may cancel at any time; your plan remains active until the end of the billing period. We do not offer refunds for partial months.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">4. Service availability</h2>
      <p>We aim for high availability but do not guarantee uninterrupted service. We may modify or discontinue features at any time. We will give reasonable notice of significant changes.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">5. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>The Service is provided "as is". We are not liable for missed job alerts, missed opportunities, or any indirect damages arising from your use of the Service. Our liability is limited to the amount you paid us in the 30 days prior to the claim.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">6. Termination</h2>
      <p>We may suspend or terminate your account if you violate these terms. You may delete your account at any time from your account settings.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">7. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@careerwatch.io" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">hello@careerwatch.io</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
